-- ABET Content OS update 7: 7 poster/ad looks, carousels and PDF guides (owner's references). Safe: keeps all data; safe to run again.
begin;
-- ABET poster, carousel and PDF styles (owner's references, 26 Nov 2026). Retires the plain starter carousel and guide.
